 just a key on Premiere  Pro right it's just you just driving and  drop no oh my gosh that's but most of my  time editing was just spent trying to  get that green screen right and I know I  know it's not perfect okay  but hopefully it brings a bit of charm  to it because it's not perfect but I've  tried I tried my best the story is there  that I'm basically wearing my heart on  my sleeve for you guys I am naked if you  would see it that way because you're  being able to see straight through me  into my experiences into a place where I  feel most myself and that I love and  that is the forest and I'm being chased  by my past by people in my past by  memories but I'm not scared of them you  learn to love and appreciate what  hardships you went through to make you  who you are today I'm not gonna say a  better person but it's who you are today  very chilled an interesting one and it's  the worst one on the EP it's it's one  that took Jamie and I a long time to get  right because it means a lot to me and  therefore I don't want to talk about it  to him depth but it was a song that I  wrote and I didn't even realize what I  was writing it about it was about  hardships in my past that I went through  that made me have to realize where my  strengths lied and also where my  weaknesses lied and it's basically about  me and where I retreat to whenever I  feel I can't do something I feel  uncomfortable and that's behind my brave  face essentially I wanted brave face to  be a lot more war than the other songs  on the track I wanted to feel very  wishy-washy kind of like you were inside  my mind hence why you have that kind of  eerie feel to it that you will know when  you listen to it this is just the story  of a girl who's so de hurt now she's  forgotten she's gone and then fresh  start is the newest  track away I'm not really proud of that  one it fend from me actually wanted to  just tell a story through my music  because I do enjoy writing little  stories as well so I wanted it to sound  like I was telling you guys a story and  like I had a protagonist and I was  talking about something in in particular  the way that I see it is that there's  this little shadowy guy who's like all  shady like I'll buy your heart and I can  give you this and opens up his trench  coat that's kind of how I viewed it but  obviously it has a bigger meaning than  just that as I was writing it it was  about a girl who couldn't handle hat  anymore couldn't handle damage couldn't  handle sadness because we all get  through those times where we just feel  like it's too much and we'd rather just  become a robot we'd rather just become  just soulless and not feel anything  would be better than feeling what you're  feeling right now however if we were to  give that away then we wouldn't  appreciate the good times that come we  wouldn't be able to to understand what  it's like to to feel happy to feel sad  to form bonds with other people too to  have importance around things that that  we love and that resonate with us  so sometimes we just need to accept that  we are going to get upset and be down  and be okay with that because at the end  of the day you can't live without a  heart not human beings not as human  beings if we give that away we we give  ourselves away and we become nothing so  that's kind of what the hot ones about  but yeah I hope you enjoyed this little  deep dive into the behind the scenes of  the EP I will be making more music  because I freaking love it and why not  just do things that you love please do  subscribe and follow for more music you  can also follow me on Instagram I put up  a lot of videos of me just in my pajamas  singing if in my room so if you want to  see videos like that it's a wee more so  on my Instagram there's more content to  come  you might notice I've been away for a  while and that's because I've moved  house again there's a lot of things to  catch you up on and we'll do that in  another video but you will see this face  more often till then listen to sweater  if you want it you don't have to but  thank you for doing it okay  when I go down have low easy or evening  and thanks again  I  [Music]  [Music]  [Music]  there are some sweater
 

